## 11. Design Principle

The central design concept is:

> **An internal Y-shaped structure is used specifically for liquid-phase collection within a multiphase fluidized-bed reactor.**

The geometry will be used to investigate multiphase flow behaviour, phase distribution, liquid collection, and reactor performance.
